5. Develop a long-term plan to refactor the codebase to improve maintainability and make it more suitable for automated regression testing. This may involve refactoring existing code, introducing design patterns or principles (e.g., SOLID), and adopting best practices for coding standards and testing.

Example:
```java
// Create a roadmap document outlining long-term improvements
public class RegressionRoadmap {
    private String goal;
    private String description;

    public RegressionRoadmap(String goal, String description) {
        this.goal = goal;
        this.description = description;
    }

    public String getGoal() {
        return goal;
    }

    public String getDescription() {
        return description;
    }
}

// Create a list of long-term goals and descriptions
List<RegressionRoadmap> roadmap = new ArrayList<>();
roadmap.add(new RegressionRoadmap("Refactor MyService to use dependency injection", "Replace hardcoded dependencies with Spring's dependency injection framework"));
```
